        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: The Legend of Frosty the Snowman, SpongeBob SquarePants, Coach\n- Companies: Classic Media, Studio B Productions\n- People: Burt Reynolds, Bill Fagerbakke\n- Topics: direct-to-video animated films, rebooted back-story, continuity\n\nFacts:\n- The Legend of Frosty the Snowman is a 2005 American/Canadian direct-to-video animated film.\n- Classic Media and Studio B Productions produced The Legend of Frosty the Snowman.\n- Burt Reynolds narrated and sang in The Legend of Frosty the Snowman.\n- Bill Fagerbakke played Frosty in The Legend of Frosty the Snowman.\n- The Legend of Frosty the Snowman has very little continuity with the original and features a rebooted back-story.\n- Bill Fagerbakke is best known for his long-running roles as Patrick Star in SpongeBob SquarePants and Michael \"Dauber\" Dybinski on Coach.",
